          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 73670,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Impariamo ad aggiungere e rimuovere valori con gli array. Come questa app per la lista delle cose da fare, che usa un array per aggiungere e rimuovere attività.</p><webview version=\"2\" visible-if=\"always\" content=\"&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&#xA;&lt;head&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;title&gt;To-Do List&lt;/title&gt;&#xA;    &lt;style&gt;&#xA;        body {&#xA;            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            justify-content: center;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin: 0;&#xA;            background-color: #f5f5f5;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-container {&#xA;            background-color: white;&#xA;            padding: 20px;&#xA;            border-radius: 10px;&#xA;            margin: 24px auto;&#xA;            box-shadow: 0 4px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);&#xA;        }&#xA;        h1 {&#xA;            font-size: 24px;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 20px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item {&#xA;            display: flex;&#xA;            align-items: center;&#xA;            margin-bottom: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;] {&#xA;            width: 20px;&#xA;            height: 20px;&#xA;            margin-right: 10px;&#xA;        }&#xA;        .todo-item.completed span {&#xA;            text-decoration: line-through;&#xA;            color: #ccc;&#xA;        }&#xA;    &lt;/style&gt;&#xA;&lt;/head&gt;&#xA;&lt;body&gt;&#xA;    &lt;div class=&quot;todo-container&quot;&gt;&#xA;        &lt;h1&gt;To-Dos&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-1&quot; checked&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy clear nail polish 💅&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-2&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;buy soap bar 🧼&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-3&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;paint soap with nail-polish&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-4&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;casually leave soap in bathroom&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;        &lt;div class=&quot;todo-item&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;input type=&quot;checkbox&quot; id=&quot;todo-5&quot;&gt;&#xA;            &lt;span&gt;enjoy&lt;/span&gt;&#xA;        &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;    &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&#xA;    &lt;script&gt;&#xA;        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {&#xA;            const checkboxes = document.querySelectorAll('.todo-item input[type=&quot;checkbox&quot;]');&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                checkbox.addEventListener('change', function() {&#xA;                    if (this.checked) {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                    } else {&#xA;                        this.parentNode.classList.remove('completed');&#xA;                    }&#xA;                });&#xA;            });&#xA;&#xA;            checkboxes.forEach(checkbox =&gt; {&#xA;                if (checkbox.checked) {&#xA;                    checkbox.parentNode.classList.add('completed');&#xA;                }&#xA;            });&#xA;        });&#xA;    &lt;/script&gt;&#xA;&lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Push",
            "id": 73671,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere un valore come <code>\"groceries\"</code> a un array, scriviamo il nome dell'array <code>toDo</code>, seguito da un punto <code>.</code>, quindi il metodo dell'array <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>toDo</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per aggiungere un valore come <code>\"groceries\"</code> a un array, scriviamo il nome dell'array <code>toDo</code>, seguito da un punto <code>.</code>, quindi il metodo dell'array <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>. Aggiungi la nuova attività in modo che l'array visualizzato termini con <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop(&quot;groceries&quot;)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"tasks\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push(groceries)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>toDo</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>push(\"groceries\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "End of the array",
            "id": 73672,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'aggiunta di un valore con il metodo <code>.push()</code> lo inserisce alla fine dell'array.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungere un valore con <code>.push()</code> lo inserisce alla fine dell'array. Fai visualizzare <code>\"groceries\"</code> per ultimo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"groceries\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pop\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>push</code>, seguito da <code>\"groceries\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "More values",
            "id": 73673,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo aggiungere più valori con <code>.push()</code> separandoli con una virgola <code>,</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries', 'feed cat' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo aggiungere più valori con <code>.push()</code> separandoli con una virgola <code>,</code>. Aggiungi entrambe le attività con una sola chiamata, in modo che <code>\"feed cat\"</code> sia l'ultima.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;groceries&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;feed cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom', 'dishes', 'groceries', 'feed cat' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Pop",
            "id": 73674,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Per rimuovere l'ultimo elemento dell'array, scrivi il nome dell'array <code>toDo</code>, un punto <code>.</code> e il metodo dell'array <code>pop()</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(toDo);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"push\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'call mom' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>toDo</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>pop</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Store removed element",
            "id": 73676,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando assegniamo <code>toDo.pop()</code> a una variabile, la variabile memorizza il valore che stiamo rimuovendo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(chore);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>chore</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando assegniamo <code>toDo.pop()</code> a una variabile, la variabile memorizza il valore che stiamo rimuovendo. Memorizza il valore rimosso in <code>chore</code> e visualizza <code>dishes</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" toDo = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;call mom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dishes&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" chore = toDo.pop();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(chore);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"toDo\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\":\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"dishes\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>chore</code>, seguito da <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Push",
            "id": 73870,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale metodo usiamo per aggiungere un valore a un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.push()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un array contiene <code>\"call mom\"</code>. Quale chiamata aggiunge <code>\"groceries\"</code> senza rimuovere nulla?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.shift()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.push()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: End of the array",
            "id": 73871,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dove va un nuovo valore che aggiungiamo con <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Alla fine dell'array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">All'inizio dell'array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Alla fine dell'array.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Partendo da <code>[\"call mom\", \"dishes\"]</code>, usi <code>.push(\"groceries\")</code>. Dove si trova <code>\"groceries\"</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Alla fine dell'array</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">All'inizio dell'array</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sostituisce l'ultimo valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Alla fine dell'array.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: More values",
            "id": 73872,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quanti valori possiamo aggiungere a un array usando <code>.push()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Quanti ne vogliamo</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Un solo valore alla volta</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Quanti ne vogliamo.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Cosa può aggiungere <code>toDo.push(\"groceries\", \"feed cat\")</code> durante questa singola chiamata al metodo?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Entrambi i valori</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Solo il primo valore</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo un valore perché <code>.push()</code> accetta un solo valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere Entrambi i valori.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Pop",
            "id": 73873,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale metodo usiamo per rimuovere l'ultimo elemento di un array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.push()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un array termina con <code>\"dishes\"</code>. Quale metodo rimuove quest'ultimo elemento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>.pop()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.push()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.shift()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.pop()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Store removed element",
            "id": 73874,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Come possiamo salvare il valore rimosso da <code>.pop()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Memorizzandolo in una variabile</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Non possiamo salvarlo perché <code>.pop()</code> non restituisce un valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Memorizzandolo in una variabile.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo <code>const removed = toDo.pop()</code>, cosa memorizza <code>removed</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Il valore che si trovava per ultimo in <code>toDo</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">L'array dopo la rimozione del suo ultimo valore</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nulla, perché <code>.pop()</code> non restituisce alcun valore</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Il valore che si trovava per ultimo in <code>toDo</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Push",
            "id": 73876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>\"joe\"</code> all'array degli utenti attivi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeUsers);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>activeUsers</code>, seguito da <code>.push(\"joe\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>L'array deve visualizzare <code>[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]</code>. Aggiungi <code>\"joe\"</code> senza rimuovere nessuno dei due utenti attivi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" activeUsers = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;mike&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"activeUsers.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(activeUsers);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".pop()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".push(joe)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'sue', 'mike', 'joe' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>activeUsers</code>, seguito da <code>.push(\"joe\")</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: End of the array",
            "id": 73877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aggiungi <code>\"sugar\"</code> alla fine dell'array scrivendo <code>.push(\"sugar\")</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cookies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;flour&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;butter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"cookies.push(\" /><text value=\"&quot;sugar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cookies);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"58\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 'flour', 'butter', 'sugar' ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di digitare <code>.push(\"sugar\")</code>.</p></body></html>"
